  "description": {
    "text": "A file of nine cards, each of a different type, whose art is cut from three panoramas: a forest painted by Sumiyoshi Kizuki (Celebi, Sudowoodo and Sneasel), the Burned Tower by Naoyo Kimura (Raikou, Entei and Suicune) and the sky by Aya Kusube (Lugia, Ho-Oh and Skarmory). Beside Celebi, a mythical Pokémon, are the five legendary Pokémon of Gold and Silver: Raikou, Entei, Suicune, Lugia and Ho-Oh.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
